      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Beta radiation(\u03B2) is moderately ionising as they can penetrade moderately
    far into a material before they collide.\nThey have a few meters of range in
    air and can be absorbed by a 5mm thick sheet of aluminium\nBeta radiation(\u03B2)
    can be very useful due to its penetration distance and can be used to test metal
    thickness as the particle isnt instantly absorbed opposed to Alpha radiation."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
